<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Ehrbar — simple game top-ups and gift cards in Jamaica." />
  <title>Ehrbar | Game Top-Ups Jamaica</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f7f8fa;
      --card:#ffffff;
      --text:#111827;
      --muted:#6b7280;
      --line:#e5e7eb;
      --brand:#14532d;
      --brand2:#16a34a;
      --soft:#ecfdf3;
      --shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(17,24,39,.07);
      --radius:18px;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background:var(--bg);
      color:var(--text);
      line-height:1.55;
    }
    a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
    .wrap{width:min(1120px,92%);margin:auto}
    header{
      position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
      backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
    }
    nav{height:72px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
    .brand{font-size:1.45rem;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-.04em}
    .brand span{color:var(--brand2)}
    .navlinks{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;font-size:.95rem;color:#374151}
    .btn{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
      padding:12px 18px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:750;
      border:1px solid transparent;transition:.18s ease;
    }
    .btn.primary{background:var(--brand);color:white}
    .btn.primary:hover{background:#0f4425;transform:translateY(-1px)}
    .btn.secondary{background:white;border-color:var(--line)}
    .btn.secondary:hover{border-color:#cbd5e1}
    .hero{padding:82px 0 58px}
    .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}
    .eyebrow{
      display:inline-block;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:999px;
      background:var(--soft);color:var(--brand);font-weight:750;font-size:.82rem;
    }
    h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,6vw,5.1rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:18px 0}
    .lead{font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:660px}
    .hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}
    .trust{display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px;color:#4b5563;font-size:.9rem}
    .hero-card{
      background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#f0fdf4);
      border:1px solid #d1fae5;border-radius:26px;padding:28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)
    }
    .hero-card h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.35rem}
    .mini{color:var(--muted);font-size:.94rem}
    .price-example{margin-top:22px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:18px}
    .price-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)}
    .price-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}
    section{padding:66px 0}
    .section-title{font-size:2rem;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0 0 8px}
    .section-sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 30px}
    .games{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
    .game{
      background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);
      padding:22px;box-shadow:0 7px 25px rgba(17,24,39,.035)
    }
    .game .icon{
      width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:13px;background:var(--soft);
      display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.35rem;margin-bottom:18px
    }
    .game h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:1.05rem}
    .game p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}
    .pricing{
      background:#111827;color:white
    }
    .pricing .section-sub{color:#9ca3af}
    .tiers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px}
    .tier{
      background:#18202d;border:1px solid #273244;border-radius:18px;padding:22px
    }
    .tier .amount{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:850;margin:8px 0}
    .tier .mark{color:#86efac;font-weight:850;font-size:1.1rem}
    .note{margin-top:18px;color:#9ca3af;font-size:.9rem}
    .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px}
    .step{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:22px}
    .num{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:850;margin-bottom:16px}
    .contact{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}
    .contact-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .contact-links{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:20px}
    .contact-link{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;padding:14px 16px;font-weight:700}
    .contact-link:hover{border-color:#9ca3af}
    .game details{margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:14px}
    .game summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand);list-style:none}
    .game summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
    .game summary::after{content:"+";float:right}
    .game details[open] summary::after{content:"−"}
    .options{margin-top:12px;display:grid;gap:9px}
    .option{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:14px;align-items:center;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 12px}
    .option small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;margin-top:2px}
    .option strong{white-space:nowrap}
    .rate-box{margin-top:22px;padding:16px 18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;color:#374151;font-size:.92rem}
    .reviews-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:24px}
    .review{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:20px}
    .review .stars{letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:9px}
    .sample-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f3f4f6;color:#6b7280;margin-bottom:10px}
    .review-form{margin-top:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:24px}
    .field{display:grid;gap:7px;margin-bottom:14px}
    .field label{font-weight:750;font-size:.9rem}
    .field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;font:inherit;border:1px solid #d1d5db;border-radius:11px;padding:11px 12px;background:#fff}
    .field textarea{min-height:105px;resize:vertical}
    footer{padding:32px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem}
    .footer-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    @media (max-width:850px){
      .navlinks a:not(.nav-cta){display:none}
      .hero-grid,.contact{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .games{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
      .reviews-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .tiers,.steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
      .hero{padding-top:56px}
    }
    @media (max-width:560px){
      .games,.tiers,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      nav{height:64px}
      h1{font-size:3rem}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav>
      <a class="brand" href="#">Ehr<span>bar</span></a>
      <div class="navlinks">
        <a href="#games">Games</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
        <a href="#how">How it works</a>
        <a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        <a class="btn primary nav-cta" href="https://wa.me/18764526429?text=Hi%20Ehrbar%2C%20I%20want%20to%20make%20a%20top-up." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">GAME TOP-UPS • JAMAICA</span>
        <h1>Top up without the hassle.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Game top-ups and gift cards with simple local ordering. Choose what you want, message Ehrbar, confirm your price, and complete your order.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="https://wa.me/18764526429?text=Hi%20Ehrbar%2C%20I%20want%20to%20make%20a%20top-up." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Order on WhatsApp</a>
          <a class="btn secondary" href="#games">Browse games</a>
        </div>
        <div class="trust">
          <span>✓ Clear pricing</span>
          <span>✓ Simple ordering</span>
          <span>✓ Bigger orders, lower markup</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-card">
        <h3>Fair markup, not crazy prices.</h3>
        <p class="mini">Markup gets smaller as the order gets larger.</p>
        <div class="price-example">
          <div class="price-row"><span>Your total cost: J$1,000</span><strong>Example: J$1,150</strong></div>
          <div class="price-row"><span>Your total cost: J$2,000</span><strong>Example: J$2,240</strong></div>
          <div class="price-row"><span>Your total cost: J$5,000</span><strong>Example: J$5,500</strong></div>
          <div class="price-row"><span>Your total cost: J$10,000</span><strong>Example: J$10,800</strong></div>
        </div>
        <p class="mini" style="margin-top:14px">Final prices can change with exchange rates and platform fees. You confirm the price before paying.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="games">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">What you can order</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Start with the main services below. More can be added later.</p>
      <div class="games">
        <div class="game"><div class="icon">◈</div><h3>Roblox</h3><p>Robux purchased through supported Roblox options.</p>
          <details><summary>View amounts & prices</summary><div class="options">
            <div class="option"><span><b>400 Robux</b><small>US$4.99 ≈ J$790 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$900</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>800 Robux</b><small>US$9.99 ≈ J$1,580 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$1,750</strong></div>
