            <div class="option"><span><b>4,500 Robux</b><small>US$49.99 ≈ J$7,900 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$8,550</strong></div>
          </div></details></div>
        <div class="game"><div class="icon">🔥</div><h3>Free Fire</h3><p>Diamond top-ups. Exact diamond bundles can vary by supplier/region.</p>
          <details><summary>View example budgets</summary><div class="options">
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$1 budget</b><small>≈ J$158 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$200</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$5 budget</b><small>≈ J$790 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$900</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$10 budget</b><small>≈ J$1,580 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$1,750</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$20 budget</b><small>≈ J$3,160 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$3,500</strong></div>
