        <div class="game"><div class="icon">◉</div><h3>Steam</h3><p>Steam Wallet digital gift-card values.</p>
          <details><summary>View amounts & prices</summary><div class="options">
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$5</b><small>≈ J$790 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$900</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$10</b><small>≈ J$1,580 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$1,750</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$25</b><small>≈ J$3,950 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$4,350</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$50</b><small>≈ J$7,900 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$8,550</strong></div>
          </div></details></div>
        <div class="game"><div class="icon">△</div><h3>PlayStation</h3><p>PlayStation Store gift cards. Account region must match the voucher region.</p>
          <details><summary>View amounts & prices</summary><div class="options">
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$10</b><small>≈ J$1,580 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$1,750</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$25</b><small>≈ J$3,950 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$4,350</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$50</b><small>≈ J$7,900 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$8,550</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$100</b><small>≈ J$15,800 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$17,050</strong></div>
          </div></details></div>
        <div class="game"><div class="icon">X</div><h3>Xbox</h3><p>Xbox/Microsoft gift-card values. Region compatibility is confirmed first.</p>
          <details><summary>View amounts & prices</summary><div class="options">
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$10</b><small>≈ J$1,580 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$1,750</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$25</b><small>≈ J$3,950 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$4,350</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$50</b><small>≈ J$7,900 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$8,550</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$100</b><small>≈ J$15,800 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$17,050</strong></div>
          </div></details></div>
        <div class="game"><div class="icon">🛍</div><h3>Temu / Shopping</h3><p>Message to check what supported payment or gift-card option is available.</p>
          <details><summary>View example budgets</summary><div class="options">
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$10 purchase</b><small>≈ J$1,580 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$1,750</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$25 purchase</b><small>≈ J$3,950 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$4,350</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$50 purchase</b><small>≈ J$7,900 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$8,550</strong></div>
            <div class="option"><span><b>US$100 purchase</b><small>≈ J$15,800 base</small></span><strong>≈ J$17,050</strong></div>
