      <div class="rate-box"><strong>Conversion used for examples:</strong> US$1 ≈ J$158. Prices are estimates and already include the tiered Ehrbar markup shown below. Exchange rates, taxes, platform prices and card/supplier fees can change, so the final price is always confirmed before you pay.</div>
