  </section>

  <section class="pricing" id="pricing">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">Simple pricing</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">The percentage is added after the actual product cost, conversion, and unavoidable purchase fees.</p>
      <div class="tiers">
        <div class="tier"><div>Orders up to</div><div class="amount">J$1,000</div><div class="mark">+15%</div></div>
        <div class="tier"><div>J$1,001 –</div><div class="amount">J$2,500</div><div class="mark">+12%</div></div>
        <div class="tier"><div>J$2,501 –</div><div class="amount">J$5,000</div><div class="mark">+10%</div></div>
        <div class="tier"><div>Over</div><div class="amount">J$5,000</div><div class="mark">+8%</div></div>
      </div>
      <p class="note">Prices should be rounded to a convenient amount, such as the nearest J$50. Always send the customer the final total before accepting payment.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">How it works</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Four straightforward steps.</p>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><strong>Choose</strong><p class="mini">Pick the game, gift card, or top-up you want.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><strong>Message</strong><p class="mini">Send the item and amount through WhatsApp or Instagram.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="num">3</div><strong>Confirm</strong><p class="mini">Get the exact JMD total and payment instructions.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="num">4</div><strong>Receive</strong><p class="mini">After payment is confirmed, your order is completed.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="reviews">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">Customer reviews</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">This section is ready for real customer feedback. The cards below are clearly marked examples for the site layout.</p>
      <div class="reviews-grid">
        <div class="review"><span class="sample-tag">SAMPLE REVIEW</span><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><strong>“Quick and straightforward.”</strong><p class="mini">Example text: “Messaged what I wanted, got the total, paid and received it without confusion.”</p><small>— Sample customer</small></div>
        <div class="review"><span class="sample-tag">SAMPLE REVIEW</span><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><strong>“Price was clear before I paid.”</strong><p class="mini">Example text: “I liked seeing the JMD total first so I knew exactly what I was paying.”</p><small>— Sample customer</small></div>
        <div class="review"><span class="sample-tag">SAMPLE REVIEW</span><div class="stars">★★★★☆</div><strong>“Easy to order.”</strong><p class="mini">Example text: “The WhatsApp ordering process was simple and I got help choosing the right region.”</p><small>— Sample customer</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="review-form">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Leave a review</h3>
        <p class="mini">Preview form only — it does not submit anywhere yet.</p>
        <div class="field"><label>Name</label><input type="text" placeholder="Your name"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Rating</label><select><option>5 stars</option><option>4 stars</option><option>3 stars</option><option>2 stars</option><option>1 star</option></select></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Review</label><textarea placeholder="How was your order?"></textarea></div>
        <button class="btn primary" type="button" onclick="alert('Review form demo only — submissions are not enabled yet.')">Submit review</button>
