  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <div class="wrap contact">
      <div class="contact-card">
        <span class="eyebrow">CONTACT</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:14px">Ready to order?</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">Message with the game, amount, and what you want to buy.</p>
        <div class="contact-links">
          <a class="contact-link" href="https://wa.me/18764526429?text=Hi%20Ehrbar%2C%20I%20want%20to%20make%20a%20top-up." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp: +1 (876) 452-6429</a>
          <a class="contact-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/rushaun227/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram: @rushaun227</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-card">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Before you pay</h3>
        <p class="mini">Confirm the exact item, region/account requirements, and final price first. Never send passwords, card details, or login codes.</p>
        <p class="mini"><strong>Tip:</strong> A separate business email and business contact number are safer for a public website than personal contact details.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap footer-row">
    <div><strong>Ehrbar</strong> — Game top-ups & gift cards</div>
    <div>Jamaica • Prices confirmed before payment</div>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
